# 01 .idea
# 忽略IntelliJ IDEA相关的配置文件和目录
# Ignore IntelliJ IDEA related configuration files and directories
.idea

# 02 **/tmp/*
# 忽略所有路径下的tmp目录及其所有内容
# Ignore tmp directories and all their contents under all paths
**/tmp/*

# 03 !**/tmp/.gitkeep
# 但不忽略.gitkeep文件，即使它在tmp目录中
# But do not ignore .gitkeep files, even if they are in tmp directories
!**/tmp/.gitkeep

# 04 **/structure/*
# 忽略所有路径下的structure目录及其所有内容
# Ignore structure directories and all their contents under all paths
structure

# 05 !**/structure/.gitkeep
# 但不忽略.gitkeep文件，即使它在structure目录中
# But do not ignore .gitkeep files, even if they are in structure directories
!structure/.gitkeep

# 06 **/*prompt*
# 忽略任何深度下，文件名包含prompt的文件
# Ignore files with names containing prompt at any depth
**/prompt*

.claude

# 07 .process/archive/
# 忽略作品目录下的归档目录（历史版本由 Git 追踪，但归档目录内的大文件或生成文件可忽略）
**/.process/archive/*.pdf
**/.process/archive/*.png
**/.process/archive/*.jpg

# 08 *.bak
# 忽略备份文件
*.bak
*.backup

# 09 CLAUDE.md
# AI 协作速查手册为本地辅助文档，不纳入版本控制
CLAUDE.md

